{"ticker":{"symbol":"475040.KQ","name":"스트라드비젼","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":2230.0,"change_pct":0.01133786848072571,"market_cap":118758957056.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":1910.0,"week52_high":11080.0,"sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Application","country":"South Korea","city":"Pohang","employees":null,"website":"https://www.stradvision.com","business_summary":"Stradvision, Inc. develops learning-based perception software for autonomous vehicles and driver assistance systems. The company offers products, such as SVNet, a deep-learning-based perception software that processes data from camera sensors for high-accuracy object detection; FrontVision, which analyzes front-camera video to detect vehicles, pedestrians, and traffic signs; SurroundVision, which uses surround-view cameras for object recognition in parking environments; and MultiVision, which integrates multiple camera feeds to provide a 360 degree view for safety. The company was founded in 2014 and is based in Pohang, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"Stradvision, Inc.는 자율주행차 및 운전자 지원 시스템을 위한 학습 기반 인식 소프트웨어를 개발합니다. 이 회사는 고정밀 물체 감지를 위해 카메라 센서의 데이터를 처리하는 딥 러닝 기반 인식 소프트웨어인 SVNet과 같은 제품을 제공합니다. 전면 카메라 영상을 분석해 차량, 보행자, 교통 표지판을 감지하는 FrontVision 주차 환경에서 물체 인식을 위해 서라운드 뷰 카메라를 사용하는 SurroundVision; 다중 카메라 피드를 통합하여 안전을 위한 360도 뷰를 제공하는 MultiVision이 있습니다. 이 회사는 2014년에 설립되었으며 대한민국 포항에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"응용 소프트웨어","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":6621497050.0,"operating_income":-55173370990.0,"net_income":-65572943810.0,"eps":-509887.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":7171271920.0,"operating_income":-64903683880.0,"net_income":-54408186840.0,"eps":-3886.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":11539392250.0,"operating_income":-63875179750.0,"net_income":-65528736730.0,"e